From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
This is a dynamic list and may never be able to satisfy particular standards for completeness. You can help by editing the page to add missing items, with references to reliable sources.
This list contains the top 50 accounts with the most followers on the social media platform X, formerly and commonly known as Twitter. As of March 2026[update], Elon Musk, the owner of the website, has the most-followed account with over 236 million followers. He partially acquired these followers through changing the code of the platform to promote his own posts more favorably.
Other notable figures such as Presidents Barack Obama and Donald Trump, Prime Minister Narendra Modi and Cristiano Ronaldo each have over 100 million followers. Katy Perry was the first person to surpass the 100 million follower milestone, in June 2017.
